{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based dungeon crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a uniquely generated map layout and encounter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a variety of enemies and events. Build your party as you travel deeper into the dungeon and conquer the labyrinth through the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler RPG and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/6c34564dd086ce9ac6e2bc5015924cd0.poster.avif?t=1759042931\" width=640 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/6c34564dd086ce9ac6e2bc5015924cd0.webm?t=1759042931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based party combat: each character and enemy takes will take one turn at a time before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shows the outcome of your actions in complex senerios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ed384b3ac5f31997109cd8823eb54977.poster.avif?t=1759042931\" width=640 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ed384b3ac5f31997109cd8823eb54977.webm?t=1759042931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v